@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
scale 950 width
skinparam nodesep 30
skinparam ranksep 80

actor "Người dùng" as User
actor "Dịch vụ Email" as EmailService <<External>>

rectangle "Chức năng: Xóa tài khoản" {
    usecase "Xóa tài khoản" as UC_DeleteAccount
    usecase "Xem cảnh báo điều khoản" as UC_ViewWarning
    usecase "Khảo sát lý do rời bỏ" as UC_SurveyReason
    usecase "Xác thực mật khẩu" as UC_VerifyPassword
    usecase "Quên mật khẩu" as UC_ForgotPassword
    usecase "Huỷ thao tác" as UC_CancelAction
    usecase "Gửi email đặt lại mật khẩu" as UC_SendEmail
}

User --> UC_DeleteAccount

UC_DeleteAccount .> UC_ViewWarning : <<include>>
UC_DeleteAccount .> UC_SurveyReason : <<include>>
UC_DeleteAccount .> UC_VerifyPassword : <<include>>
UC_ForgotPassword .> UC_DeleteAccount : <<extend>>
UC_CancelAction .> UC_DeleteAccount : <<extend>>
UC_ForgotPassword .> UC_SendEmail : <<include>>

UC_SendEmail ..> EmailService : <<interact>>

note right of UC_SurveyReason
Lý do ngừng dùng:
- Lỗi ứng dụng
- Quá nhiều QC / Quá đắt
- Chuyển sang app khác
- Vấn đề bảo mật
end note

@enduml